OL,3,GNEWSA#15m for zero-emission testing at
OL,4,ABelfast Harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelfast Harbour is to become a live
OL,7,Fenvironment for testing zero-emission
OL,8,Ftransport and energy systems.
OL,10,FIt comes after a #15m investment from
OL,11,FUK Research and Innovation's Local
OL,12,FInnovation Partnerships Fund.
OL,14,FThe cluster led by Artemis
OL,15,FTechnologies, will connect electric
OL,16,Fvessels, high-power marine charging,
OL,17,Fautonomous transport and energy systems
OL,18,Fthrough secure digital twin technology.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
